{"schemaVersion":1,"shard":86,"count":30,"items":[{"key":"[\"B1L03-1-02\",\"礼物\",\"禮物\",\"礼物\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我要去買禮物。","pinyin":"Wǒ yào qù mǎi lǐwù.","english":"I am going to buy gifts.","sourceCardId":"B1L03-1-02","sourceFront":"禮物","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"明天是媽媽的生日，你想送她什麼禮物？","pinyin":"Míngtiān shì māma de shēngrì, nǐ xiǎng sòng tā shénme lǐwù?","english":"Tomorrow is mom’s birthday, what do you want to give her as a gift?","sourceCardId":"B1L03-1-04","sourceFront":"送","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"明天是友美的生日，我想送她一個禮物。","pinyin":"Míngtiān shì Yǒuměi de shēngrì, wǒ xiǎng sòng tā yí ge lǐwù.","english":"It is Youmei’s birthday tomorrow; I would like to give her a gift.","sourceCardId":"B1L03-1-01","sourceFront":"買","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"謝謝，這是我去年的生日禮物。","pinyin":"Xièxie, zhè shì wǒ qùnián de shēngrì lǐwù.","english":"Thanks, this is my birthday gift from last year.","sourceCardId":"B1L08-1-01","sourceFront":"裙子","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L03-2-08\",\"枝\",\"枝\",\"枝\",\"M\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我有兩枝鉛筆。","pinyin":"Wǒ yǒu liǎng zhī qiānbǐ.","english":"I have two pencils.","sourceCardId":"B1L03-2-08","sourceFront":"枝","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"一枝筆幾塊錢？","pinyin":"Yì zhī bǐ jǐ kuài qián?","english":"How much is a pen?","sourceCardId":"B1L03-2-10","sourceFront":"錢","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"我們買兩枝，好不好？兩枝五十塊錢。","pinyin":"Wǒmen mǎi liǎng zhī, hǎo bù hǎo? Liǎng zhī wǔshí kuài qián.","english":"How about we buy two of them? Two for 50NT dollars.","sourceCardId":"B1L03-2-01","sourceFront":"這","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"這枝筆太貴了，你買便宜的吧。","pinyin":"Zhè zhī bǐ tài guì le, nǐ mǎi piányi de ba.","english":"This pen is too expensive, you had better buy a cheaper one.","sourceCardId":"B1L05-1-14","sourceFront":"吧","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"a 木(tree) leans on a 支(support) to hold up one 枝(branch)."},{"key":"[\"B1L10-2-18\",\"就\",\"就\",\"就\",\"Conj\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我會給你三天的藥。你要記得多喝一點兒水，要是發燒了，就吃紅色的藥。","pinyin":"Wǒ huì gěi nǐ sān tiān de yào. Nǐ yào jìde duō hē yìdiǎnr shuǐ, yàoshi fāshāo le, jiù chī hóngsè de yào.","english":"I will give you medicine for 3 days. Remember to drink plenty of water. If you have a fever, then take the red pill.","sourceCardId":"B1L10-2-01","sourceFront":"咳嗽/咳","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"他說他會去看醫生，請我們不要擔心，如果他好了，就會來學校上課。","pinyin":"Tā shuō tā huì qù kàn yīshēng, qǐng wǒmen bú yào dānxīn, rúguǒ tā hǎo le, jiù huì lái xuéxiào shàngkè.","english":"He said he will go see a doctor and he does not want to worry us. If he feels better, he will come to school.","sourceCardId":"B1L10-3-01","sourceFront":"打電話","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":3},{"chinese":"很簡單，上網一查就知道了。","pinyin":"Hěn jiǎndān, shàngwǎng yì chá jiù zhīdào le.","english":"It’s very simple. You can know it as soon as you check it online.","sourceCardId":"B1L15-1-01","sourceFront":"生肖","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我週末還要工作，打算一下班就去看燈會。我們可以約友美一起去。","pinyin":"Wǒ zhōumò hái yào gōngzuò, dǎsuàn yí xiàbān jiù qù kàn dēnghuì. Wǒmen kěyǐ yuē Yǒuměi yìqǐ qù.","english":"I have to work on weekends, and plan to go to the Lantern Carnival as soon as I get off from work. We can ask Youmei out for the Lantern Carnival together.","sourceCardId":"B1L15-2-01","sourceFront":"著","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"a 京(capital) gate opens with 尤(yóu) flair → and 就(then) we enter."},{"key":"[\"B2L01-1-20\",\"刚好\",\"剛好\",\"刚好\",\"Vaux\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我要打電話給他的時候，他剛好打來了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L01-1-20","sourceFront":"剛好","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"我到公車站的時候，剛好有一班公車來了，要不然上班就遲到了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L05-2-08","sourceFront":"要不然","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我往東走，你往西走，我們兩個的方向剛好相反。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-1-19","sourceFront":"相反","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"冷氣的溫度要是控制得剛好，不但對健康好，也能省點兒電費。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-08","sourceFront":"剛好","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L07-2-22\",\"樣子\",\"樣子\",\"样子\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"那件外套的樣子是今年最流行的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L07-2-22","sourceFront":"樣子","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"他在 KTV 唱歌的樣子，好像歌星一樣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L07-2-22","sourceFront":"樣子","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"台北101大樓的樣子看起來就像竹子一樣節節高升。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L14-2-15","sourceFront":"竹子","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我喜歡觀察小動物走來走去的樣子。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L16-2-21","sourceFront":"觀察","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"經理說，我們要一邊說笑話一邊介紹機器的功能，這樣子才賣得好","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-1-14","sourceFront":"這樣子","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小簡是一個有愛心、有禮貌的人，像這樣子的男人你要好好把握啊！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-1-14","sourceFront":"這樣子","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"A:你怎麼了？看起來很不開心的樣子。 B:唉！工廠發生問題，今天又得加班處理了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-1-40","sourceFront":"唉","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那位服務生不笑的時候，樣子看起來很兇，其實他對客人的態度很好。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L02-2-25","sourceFront":"凶","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小高總是在別人面前表現得很有禮貌，不過回到家就完全變了一個樣子。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-2-11","sourceFront":"面前","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我昨天親眼看到小史跟人吵架，才知道他罵人的樣子好可怕喔！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-2-18","sourceFront":"親眼","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那個女演員演戲的樣子很自然，一點也不誇張，難怪導演很欣賞她。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-1-12","sourceFront":"自然","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"儘管爺爺去世很久了，但每次看到照片，就會回想起他開心陪我玩的樣子。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-2-05","sourceFront":"儘管","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"顧客付了錢，賣家也交了貨，這樣子交易才算完成。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-2-19","sourceFront":"賣家","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那位客人在地攤買東西揀來揀去，最後又不買，難怪老闆滿臉不高興的樣子。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-06","sourceFront":"揀","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我坐在公園裡看著花兒隨著風搖擺，那個樣子真是可愛極了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-17","sourceFront":"搖擺","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"伯父的孩子是對雙胞胎，不只是樣子，連說話的聲音都像。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-20","sourceFront":"伯父","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"如果真心愛對方，就不必在乎對方的樣子與生活背景。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-29","sourceFront":"在乎","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有的小朋友很討厭打針，一看見護理師拿針筒(medical syringe)的樣子就哭了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-38","sourceFront":"打針","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他上班時常戴著一副黑色眼鏡，那副樣子總是讓我忘不了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-39","sourceFront":"副","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"你別看她一臉害羞的樣子，在熟人面前她可是很開朗的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-2-09","sourceFront":"熟人","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這兩臺機器樣子相同，但在構造與功能上是有差別的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-14","sourceFront":"構造","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"下午颱風就要來了，看樣子得趕快去超市買點兒食物。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-1-50","sourceFront":"看樣子","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"要保持古文物原來的樣子不容易，需要好好照顧。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-01","sourceFront":"文物","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L11-1-07\",\"選擇\",\"選擇\",\"选择\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"畢業後要工作還是要繼續念書，我得好好地想想再選擇！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L11-1-07","sourceFront":"選擇","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"你畢業後要出國留學或是留在國內工作，都是不錯的選擇。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L07-2-17","sourceFront":"國內","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"去KTV辦活動，是一個不錯的選擇。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L06-2-20","sourceFront":"選擇","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"筆電的價格和功能，都會影響顧客的選擇。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-2-27","sourceFront":"影響","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"越來越多人選擇上網購物，有的是為了節省時間，有的是因為比價很方便。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-2-17","sourceFront":"節省","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"公司的生產部門這個月規劃了員工旅遊，有三個不同地點讓大家選擇。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-2-02","sourceFront":"規劃","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"快時尚的概念，就是在短時間內提供各式各樣的流行商品，讓顧客有更多更好的選擇。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-21","sourceFront":"概念","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那家超市蔬菜水果的種類很多，可提供民眾較多的選擇。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-1-15","sourceFront":"種類","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在臺灣，上網訂好火車票後，可選擇到車站或便利商店取票。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-2-21","sourceFront":"取","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"大型體育活動常選擇在都市舉行，主要原因是交通方便。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-07","sourceFront":"大型","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"自己做的肥皂用起來比較安心，也能選擇自己喜歡的氣味。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-1-37","sourceFront":"肥皂","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這家醫院的內科有最新設備，因此成為許多病人的第一選擇。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-18","sourceFront":"內科","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L14-1-01\",\"春节\",\"春節\",\"春节\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"在春節的前一天，大多數的華人都會回到父母家一起慶祝。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L14-1-01","sourceFront":"春節","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"每年春節時，爸爸都會送隔壁鄰居一盒蘋果，祝他們每天都平安、如意。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-2-29","sourceFront":"如意","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"絕大部分的華人都很重視春節，所以回家團圓、互相拜年，他們認為都是該做的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-2-08","sourceFront":"絕大部分","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"華人過春節時有個風俗，就是每戶人家都會在門口貼春聯。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-1-43","sourceFront":"戶","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L15-1-25\",\"教育\",\"教育\",\"教育\",\"V/N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"用不同的方法教育不同的學生，這樣才是成功的教育方式。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-1-25","sourceFront":"教育","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"我們的成長經驗、教育背景都差不多，所以想法也很像。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-2-22","sourceFront":"背景","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":3},{"chinese":"父母應該好好地教育孩子，讓他們明白做人、做事的道理。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-2-26","sourceFront":"做人","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":3},{"chinese":"為了偏僻地區孩子的教育，有十幾位老師願意上山下海，到山上、海邊的學校教書。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-38","sourceFront":"上山下海","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"孔子不僅是中國偉大教師的代表，他的教育和哲學思想，對華人的影響也很大。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-2-03","sourceFront":"代表","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"青少年常因為不了解而誤會父母的教育方式，或許等他們長大了，就能真正明白了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-1-24","sourceFront":"真正","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"大學教育的目的，不僅要提高學生的知識水準，還要進一步培養學生的專業能力。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-1-14","sourceFront":"進一步","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在照顧及教育孩子上，父母都具有相同的法律義務。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-07","sourceFront":"義務","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"今天上健康教育課時，老師在教室裡掛了一張人體血管圖。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-40","sourceFront":"血管","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有些學校將教育當成商品來買賣，但也有人不支持。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-30","sourceFront":"買賣","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"教育是國家的根本，能改變國家的未來。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-2-27","sourceFront":"根本","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"政府建公立學校的目的，主要是提高人民接受教育的機會。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-2-07","sourceFront":"公立","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這所國立大學獨特的教育風格吸引了不少國外學生。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-2-08","sourceFront":"國立","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L16-2-23\",\"披萨\",\"披薩\",\"披萨\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"太太：我今天很累，不想做飯。 先生：那就叫披薩好了。又快又不麻煩。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-1-30","sourceFront":"好了","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L09-1-06\",\"反而\",\"反而\",\"反而\",\"Conj\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"好幾個人都看到他跟這場火災有關，他不但不承認，反而說是鄰居做的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-1-06","sourceFront":"反而","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"姊姊：下個星期就要大學考試了，你怎麼不用功念書，反而天天出去玩？ 弟弟：妳別管我，這是我自己的事。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-1-14","sourceFront":"管","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"許多國家因為工業進步得太快，反而使得農業慢慢不被重視了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-22","sourceFront":"工業","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"經過我的說明，他反而有些糊塗了，看來我的解釋不太清楚。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-41","sourceFront":"有些","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"貓很享受抓癢，但要是你抓錯地方或方式不對，反而會使貓發脾氣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-54","sourceFront":"抓癢","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Combining 反(reverse) and 而(and): 反而 means instead, on the contrary."},{"key":"[\"B3L15-1-23\",\"形容\",\"形容\",\"形容\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"孩子是父母最親愛的寶貝，父母對他們的愛是沒辦法用文字來形容的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-1-23","sourceFront":"形容","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":"Combining 形(form) and 容(contain): 形容 means describe."},{"key":"[\"B3L15-2-08\",\"绝大部分\",\"絕大部分\",\"绝大部分\",\"Det\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"絕大部分的華人都很重視春節，所以回家團圓、互相拜年，他們認為都是該做的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-2-08","sourceFront":"絕大部分","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"這一屆的學生絕大部分都在畢業以前找到了工作。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-2-04","sourceFront":"屆","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L04-1-37\",\"西式\",\"西式\",\"西式\",\"Vs-attr\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這家民宿提供西式、中式兩種早餐，既豐富又好吃。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-37","sourceFront":"西式","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L04-2-06\",\"算起來\",\"算起來\",\"算起来\",\"Adv\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我來臺灣，算起來才三個月而已，卻已去過十幾家茶館了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-2-06","sourceFront":"算起來","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"算起來我們已經好久沒吃餃子了，買點兒麵粉、青菜和肉，回家包餃子吧。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-1-19","sourceFront":"麵粉","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L07-1-42\",\"實現\",\"實現\",\"实现\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"每天光說夢想，一點兒用都沒有，還是努力實現比較實在。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-42","sourceFront":"實現","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"我愛看漫畫，在漫畫裡可以看見許多人們還沒實現的夢想。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-2-05","sourceFront":"漫畫","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L11-2-19\",\"起見\",\"起見\",\"起见\",\"Conj\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"為了安全起見，颱風天到山區露營的行為是被嚴格禁止的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-2-19","sourceFront":"起見","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L12-2-06\",\"學位\",\"學位\",\"学位\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"就算沒有很高的學位，只要用心一樣能對國家社會有貢獻。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-2-06","sourceFront":"學位","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"A:那所大學雖然相當著名，但我國政府不承認他們的學位(academic degree)。B:許多國家都承認那所大學的學位，貴國哪裡有不承認的道理？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-57","sourceFront":"哪裡有……的道理？","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L16-1-52\",\"金牌\",\"金牌\",\"金牌\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這面金牌是完全用金子做的，外觀也相當獨特。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-52","sourceFront":"金牌","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"word\",\"亂\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"A sharp 爪(claw) pulls tangled threads until order snaps with a bent 乚(turning stroke): 亂(anarchy)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"力量\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Harnessing muscular 力(strength) and measuring its full 量(measure) produces great 力量(strength)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"喂\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 口(mouth) with no 畏(fear) calls into the phone → one warm 喂(hello)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"如\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 女(woman) opens a 口(mouth) → a voice soft 如(as) a breeze."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"婚禮\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 婚(get married) and 禮(courtesy): 婚禮 means wedding."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"小心\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"小心 means careful: keep a small (小) heart (心) → cautious and alert."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"既然\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 既(bothand) and 然(certainly): 既然 means since, now that."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"概\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Measuring timber from a tall 木(tree) that is 既(already) felled gives a broad estimate → 概(generally)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"深入\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 深(deep) and 入(enter): 深入 means deep, profound."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"滿足\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 滿(full) and 足(foot): 滿足 means satisfied."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"進來\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"進(advance) + 來(come) → advance and come: 進來(to come in)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"風格\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"A fresh creative breeze of 風(wind) shaping unique structural 格(form): 風格 means style."}]}
